#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/examples.rst:41
msgid "记录可复现的实验"
msgstr "Record a reproducible experiment"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/examples.rst:43
msgid "分享示例时，一起提供配置文件、输入数据来源、随机种子（适用时）、模型供应商与模型 ID、关键参数、SDK 版本和代码提交。结果中保留运行日志、回放目录及评价方法，避免只有一张结论截图。"
msgstr ""
"When sharing an example, include configuration files, input data sources, random seeds where "
"applicable, model providers and IDs, key parameters, the SDK version, and the code commit. "
"Preserve run logs, the replay directory, and evaluation methods alongside results, rather than "
"providing only a screenshot of a conclusion."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/examples.rst:45
msgid ""
"LLM 采样、服务端模型更新和并发调度都可能影响行为结果；固定配置有助于比较，但不保证逐字或逐步相同。比较实验应说明重复次数、测量口径与差异范围。工作区产物见 "
":doc:`results`，外部数据说明见 :doc:`datasets`。"
msgstr ""
"LLM sampling, server-side model updates, and concurrency can affect outcomes. Fixed configuration"
" helps comparison but does not guarantee identical wording or trajectories. Report repetition "
"counts, measurement definitions, and variation when comparing experiments. See :doc:`results` for"
" workspace artifacts and :doc:`datasets` for external data documentation."

